OL,3,GNEWSAWork to repair bridge in poor
OL,4,Acondition set to begin
OL,5,
OL,6,FA four-month project to repair a bridge
OL,7,Fin Leicester is set to begin in
OL,8,FSeptember.
OL,10,FLeicester City Council said the Ocean
OL,11,FRoad bridge over Bushby Brook required
OL,12,F"extensive maintenance" to repair and
OL,13,Freplace sections that were in a poor
OL,14,Fcondition.
OL,16,FThe scheme, which starts on 1
OL,17,FSeptember, is expected to take about 16
OL,18,Fweeks to complete, and the affected
OL,19,Fsection of Ocean Road will be closed in
OL,20,Fboth directions to allow the work to be
OL,21,Fcarried out safely.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,365,360,200,160,0,100
